The power supply unit (PSU) takes mains electricity (about {220} V AC in Cameroon) and turns it into the low, steady DC voltages the parts need. A surge protector or UPS protects it from power cuts and spikes.
Expansion cards add abilities:
• graphics card (GPU): images, video and games;
• sound card: audio;
• network interface card (NIC): wired or Wi-Fi connections.
